  ('1123 Series Pattern Plate (1 x 1 Hole, 43 x 48mm)', '1123-0043-0048', 'Pattern plates provide multi-purpose build surfaces to projects both big and small! Plates featuring a 43mm width are particularly versatile for their flush fit inside goBILDA® U-Channel. This allows for unique installations, such as fourth channel walls, that equip your build with new mounting options and strengthen its structure! This 1 Hole Pattern Plate is a perfect match with 1 Hole 1120 Series U-Channel as well as 1 Hole 1121 Series Low-Side U-Channel.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1123-series-pattern-plate-1-x-1-hole-43-x-48mm/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1786/images/9498/1123-0043-0048ang1__56205__81992.1701993805.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Brackets / Aluminum Flat Brackets', 'gobilda'),
