  ('1123 Series Pattern Plate (3 x 17 Hole, 96 x 432mm)', '1123-0096-0432', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1123-series-pattern-plate-3-x-17-hole-96-x-432mm/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1282/images/6354/1123-0096-0432-Patented__86960__00758.1701992825.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Pattern Plates', 'gobilda'),
  ('1126 Series Steel Flat Bracket (1-1) - 2 Pack', '1126-0001-0001', 'Often times used to attach a threaded component to the slot on the side of goRAIL®. This 7-hole bracket reaches out past the standard 32mm mounting distance so that the heads of the screws holding this bracket to the goRAIL® are accessible even with the threaded component installed onto this bracket. It''s constructed of zinc-steel for superior strength.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1126-series-steel-flat-bracket-1-1-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/278/images/2195/1126-0001-0001__63000__12615.1701991519.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / goRAIL® / goRAIL® Accessories', 'gobilda'),
  ('Steel Gusset-Plate (3 x 3 Hole) - 4 Pack', '1126-0090-0001', 'Steel Gusset-Plates are excellent to have in your corner when you''re attaching parts at 90° to one(1) another. The plates'' eleven 4mm holes on the 8mm grid pattern allow for a nearly unlimited variety of installations–especially when you''re creating or reinforcing junctions.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/steel-gusset-plate-3-x-3-hole-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1746/images/9221/1126-0090-0001__49055__18304.1701993717.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Brackets / Steel Flat Brackets', 'gobilda'),
  ('Plastic Replacement Pack for 3210-0001-0001', '1127-0001-0001', 'This replacement pack of parts includes all of the acetal pieces found in the 3210-0001-0001 for 1121 Series Cascading Kit for Low-Side U-Channel. While the plates in the kit should never fail during normal use, we know things happen when in the heat of a robotic competition!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/plastic-replacement-pack-for-3210-0001-0001/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1116/images/5565/Acetal-Parts-Kit-Plates-Only__64245__34149.1701992575.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('Transparent Black Polycarbonate Grid Plate (1.5mm Thickness, 5 x 44 Hole, 40 x 352mm)', '1127-0040-0352', 'We''re completely transparent about our passion for building on-grid, but this time we decided to put on some shades: this Transparent Black Grid Plate brings unique polycarbonate possibilities to the goBILDA® menu of structure! Plates and panels are great for ''bot-building, whether they''re helping to guide an object into your intake mechanism or cladding to your ''bot to cover its vitals. To that end, the polycarbonate material of this Grid Plate dances a fine line across both toughness and…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/transparent-black-polycarbonate-grid-plate-1-5mm-thickness-5-x-44-hole-40-x-352mm/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2552/images/16986/1127-0040-0352-Thumbnail__98284.1787948529.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Grid Plates', 'gobilda'),
  ('Transparent Black Polycarbonate Grid Plate (1.5mm Thickness, 11 x 44 Hole, 88 x 352mm)', '1127-0088-0352', 'We''re completely transparent about our passion for building on-grid, but this time we decided to put on some shades: this Transparent Black Grid Plate brings unique polycarbonate possibilities to the goBILDA® menu of structure! Plates and panels are important to robot-building, whether they''re helping to guide an element into your collection mechanism or armoring your ''bot to cover its vitals. On that point, the polycarbonate material of this Grid Plate dances a fine line across both toughness…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/transparent-black-polycarbonate-grid-plate-1-5mm-thickness-11-x-44-hole-88-x-352mm/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2553/images/16996/1127-0088-0352-Thumbnail__80392.1787949199.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Grid Plates', 'gobilda'),
  ('Transparent Black Polycarbonate Grid Plate (1.5mm Thickness, 27 x 44 Hole, 216 x 352mm)', '1127-0216-0352', 'We''re completely transparent about our passion for building on-grid, but this time we decided to put on some shades: this Transparent Black Grid Plate brings unique polycarbonate possibilities to the goBILDA® menu of structure! Plates and panels are essential to robot-building, whether they''re helping to route an element into your collection mechanism or cladding to your ''bot to cover its vitals. To that end, the polycarbonate material of this Grid Plate dances a fine line across both…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/transparent-black-polycarbonate-grid-plate-1-5mm-thickness-27-x-44-hole-216-x-352mm/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2554/images/17008/1127-0216-0352-Thumbnail__93590.1787949758.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Grid Plates', 'gobilda'),
  ('1137 Series Steel Flat Grid Bracket (1-1) - 2 Pack', '1137-0001-0001', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1137-series-steel-flat-grid-bracket-1-1-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/663/images/3923/1137-0001-0001__94047__62543.1701992048.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / goRAIL® / goRAIL® Accessories', 'gobilda'),
  ('1137 Series Steel Flat Grid Bracket (1-2) - 2 Pack', '1137-0001-0002', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1137-series-steel-flat-grid-bracket-1-2-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/664/images/3929/1137-0001-0002__06430__43091.1701992050.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / goRAIL® / goRAIL® Accessories', 'gobilda'),
  ('1137 Series Steel Flat Grid Bracket (2-1) - 2 Pack', '1137-0002-0001', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1137-series-steel-flat-grid-bracket-2-1-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/666/images/3935/1137-0002-0001__16639__86724.1701992051.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Grid Plates', 'gobilda'),
  ('1139 Series Steel Grid Plates (3 x 7 Hole, 24 x 56mm) - 2 Pack', '1139-0024-0056', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1139-series-steel-grid-plates-3-x-7-hole-24-x-56mm-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1145/images/5743/1139-0024-0056__44925__67562.1701992631.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Grid Plates', 'gobilda'),
  ('1139 Series Steel Grid Plates (5 x 7 Hole, 40 x 56mm) - 2 Pack', '1139-0040-0056', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1139-series-steel-grid-plates-5-x-7-hole-40-x-56mm-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1147/images/5748/1139-0040-0056__15296__63135.1701992633.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Grid Plates', 'gobilda'),
  ('1140 Series Aluminum Baseplate (6mm Thickness, 144mm Diameter)', '1140-0006-0144', 'This aluminum baseplate gives your project a solid foundation to sit on. Whether it''s a robotic arm, a standing desk or a workbench, having a thick plate to add stability and provide holes to fasten it to a floor or tabletop can finish out your build. The 6mm thickness provided enough material to counterbore several holes and slots which allows M4 hardware to rest below the surface of the plate for a clean, unobstructed surface. Building a linear motion rig? The Baseplate has holes…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1140-series-aluminum-baseplate-6mm-thickness-144mm-diameter/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1357/images/13741/Ang1__19887.1732226913.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Control-Arms', 'gobilda'),
  ('Round-End Steel L-Bracket - 2 Pack', '1141-0001-0001', 'This steel angle pattern mount is an excellent solution for robust 90° joints as well as miter gear assemblies. And thanks to the 16mm goBILDA® pattern surrounding its perpendicular pair of 14mm center holes, it gives you a huge variety of mounting options! It also matches the 2.5mm thickness of goBILDA® aluminum U-Channel and plates.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/round-end-steel-l-bracket-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1794/images/9587/Ang1__95955__02173.1701993834.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Motor Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('Round-End Steel U-Bracket', '1141-0002-0001', 'While this incredibly robust Steel U-Bracket rocks the same height, width, and 2.5mm thickness of a 1-hole length of 1120 Series U-Channel, the roundedness of this bracket''s two parallel sides means higher clearance in a wide variety of use-cases—such as dead wheel setups, miter gear assemblies, and rotating applications. The roundedness also means that the hole pattern is pared down to the essentials, providing a huge variety of mounting options via the goBILDA® 16mm square pattern…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/round-end-steel-u-bracket/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2098/images/11473/1141-0002-0001__01420__75337.1711057550.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Brackets / Angle Brackets', 'gobilda'),
  ('32mm Bore Steel U-Bracket', '1141-0003-0001', 'This Steel U-Bracket is a dimensional sibling to the 1-hole length of 1120 Series U-Channel. It differs only in its steel construction and the 32mm diameter holes in its parallel sides. These two holes provide the perfect location for seating 32mm OD bearings to turn this bracket into a compact, yet robust, dual-bearing pillow block! Alternatively, you can pass a length of 32mm OD tube through the holes and create a clean T-joint with the use of one(2) or two 32mm bore clamping hubs.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/32mm-bore-steel-u-bracket/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2344/images/14329/1141-0003-0001_Ang1__89711.1736525598.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Brackets / Angle Brackets', 'gobilda'),
  ('1142 Series Steel Angle Pattern Bracket (1-1)', '1142-0001-0001', 'This steel 90° bracket is a sturdy solution for right angles in your project. Its 16mm goBILDA pattern thru-holes not only surround each of its 14mm center holes, but also include holes along both sides to provide for even more mounting options! Additionally, its asymmetrical length between perpendicular sides allows for enhanced utility in pan and tilt assemblies.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1142-series-steel-angle-pattern-bracket-1-1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1810/images/9731/1142-0001-0001_Ang1__90343__33638.1701993882.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Brackets / Angle Brackets', 'gobilda'),
  ('1143 Series Mini Low-Side U-Channel (1 Hole, 48mm Length)', '1143-0001-0048', 'This 1 Hole, 48mm Length Mini Low-Side U-Channel brings a compact core structure to your build. Its minimized footprint allows for strong small-scale construction utilizing its goBILDA® 16mm pattern holes. You can attach standoffs, spacers, block mounts, beams, and more—including motors! Why goBILDA® Channel? No matter the Series, goBILDA® channel always brings excellent benefits to your build! Built-in pattern holes— no machine shop required Designed for ball-bearing-based builds Lightweight…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1143-series-mini-low-side-u-channel-1-hole-48mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1976/images/10714/1143-0001-0048_Patented__93358__63236.1701994194.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Channel / 1143 Series Mini Low-Side U-Channel', 'gobilda'),
