  ('1143 Series Mini Low-Side U-Channel (14 Hole, 360mm Length)', '1143-0014-0360', 'This 14 Hole, 360mm Length Mini Low-Side U-Channel brings a compact core structure to your build. Its minimized footprint allows for strong small-scale construction utilizing its goBILDA® 16mm pattern holes. You can attach standoffs, spacers, block mounts, beams, and more—including motors! Why goBILDA® Channel? No matter the Series, goBILDA® channel always brings excellent benefits to your build! Built-in pattern holes— no machine shop required Designed for ball-bearing-based builds…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1143-series-mini-low-side-u-channel-14-hole-360mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1986/images/10818/1143-0014-0360_Patented__49799__36741.1701994225.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Channel / 1143 Series Mini Low-Side U-Channel', 'gobilda'),
  ('1143 Series Mini Low-Side U-Channel (15 Hole, 384mm Length)', '1143-0015-0384', 'This 15 Hole, 384mm Length Mini Low-Side U-Channel brings a compact core structure to your build. Its minimized footprint allows for strong small-scale construction utilizing its goBILDA® 16mm pattern holes. You can attach standoffs, spacers, block mounts, beams, and more—including motors! Why goBILDA® Channel? No matter the Series, goBILDA® channel always brings excellent benefits to your build! Built-in pattern holes— no machine shop required Designed for ball-bearing-based builds…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1143-series-mini-low-side-u-channel-15-hole-384mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1988/images/10842/1143-0015-0384_Patented__19771__83054.1701994232.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Channel / 1143 Series Mini Low-Side U-Channel', 'gobilda'),
  ('1143 Series Mini Low-Side U-Channel (16 Hole, 408mm Length)', '1143-0016-0408', 'This 16 Hole, 408mm Length Mini Low-Side U-Channel brings a compact core structure to your build. Its minimized footprint allows for strong small-scale construction utilizing its goBILDA® 16mm pattern holes. You can attach standoffs, spacers, block mounts, beams, and more—including motors! Why goBILDA® Channel? No matter the Series, goBILDA® channel always brings excellent benefits to your build! Built-in pattern holes— no machine shop required Designed for ball-bearing-based builds…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1143-series-mini-low-side-u-channel-16-hole-408mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1990/images/10866/1143-0016-0408_Patented__79419__79409.1701994239.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Channel / 1143 Series Mini Low-Side U-Channel', 'gobilda'),
  ('1143 Series Mini Low-Side U-Channel (17 Hole, 432mm Length)', '1143-0017-0432', 'This 17 Hole, 432mm Length Mini Low-Side U-Channel brings a compact core structure to your build. Its minimized footprint allows for strong small-scale construction utilizing its goBILDA® 16mm pattern holes. You can attach standoffs, spacers, block mounts, beams, and more—including motors! Why goBILDA® Channel? No matter the Series, goBILDA® channel always brings excellent benefits to your build! Built-in pattern holes— no machine shop required Designed for ball-bearing-based builds…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1143-series-mini-low-side-u-channel-17-hole-432mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1992/images/10890/1143-0017-0432_Patented__06400__60913.1701994247.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Channel / 1143 Series Mini Low-Side U-Channel', 'gobilda'),
  ('Threaded Steel L-Bracket (1 Hole) - 12 Pack', '1147-0001-0001', 'A multitool among goBILDA® brackets, these 1-Hole Threaded Steel L-Brackets offer essential versatility with their countless possibilities for creating and reinforcing joinings at 90°. Each of the perpendicular sides rocks a threaded hole for you to use in installations with M4 screws. All of its dimensions correspond to the goBILDA® grid: the overall bracket width, as well as the height of each hole from its center to the base, is a perfect 8mm!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/threaded-steel-l-bracket-1-hole-12-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2388/images/14878/Ang1__16488__76009.1748025188.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Threaded Plates', 'gobilda'),
  ('Threaded Steel L-Bracket (3 Hole) - 4 Pack', '1147-0001-0003', 'This Threaded Steel L-Bracket can be used as a robust 90° connector or as reinforcement to an existing junction. Both sides have three threaded holes for you to use in versatile installations via M4 screws.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/threaded-steel-l-bracket-3-hole-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2024/images/11089/1147-0001-0003_ang1__88097__46009.1701994312.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Threaded Plates', 'gobilda'),
  ('Threaded Steel L-Bracket (5 Hole) - 4 Pack', '1147-0001-0005', 'This Threaded Steel L-Bracket can be used as a robust 90° connector, as well as to create a linear junction between lengths of U-Channel. The five holes on an 8mm grid mean that the two end holes are 32mm apart: a hole-spacing dimension that''s extremely common throughout the build system. It also aligns with the outermost holes of U-Channel when creating a joint, which maximizes the junction''s rigidity. This bracket''s versatility spans far beyond channel junctions, however. Its provision of…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/threaded-steel-l-bracket-5-hole-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2389/images/14888/Ang_1__89546__32343.1748025204.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Threaded Plates', 'gobilda'),
  ('1200 Series 1-Side, 2-Post Pattern Mount (24-1)', '1200-0024-0001', 'This pattern mount fastens to structure with the threaded posts and positions the pattern 24mm from the mounting surface. The 24mm bottom-to-center distance is crucial as it allows other structural components to properly align as well as provides the proper distance for gears to mesh and drive a rotating assembly. These mounts can be used as a simple connection point while building a chassis but are also an excellent choice for holding a bearing, hub, lead-screw nut, or tube off of the mating…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1200-series-1-side-2-post-pattern-mount-24-1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/280/images/2210/1200-0024-0001__87043__33652.1701991524.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Mounts / 1-Side, 2-Post Pattern Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('1200 Series 1-Side, 2-Post Pattern Mount (32-1)', '1200-0032-0001', 'This pattern mount fastens to structure with the threaded posts, spaced 32mm apart, and positions the pattern 24mm from the mounting surface. The 24mm bottom-to-center distance is crucial as it allows other structural components to properly align as well as provides the proper distance for gears to mesh and drive a rotating assembly. The 1mm deep recess around the bore allows a 1611 Series Bearing to nest down into the bore, leaving the surface completely flush.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1200-series-1-side-2-post-pattern-mount-32-1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/282/images/2225/1200-0032-0001__75365__00929.1701991530.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Mounts / 1-Side, 2-Post Pattern Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('1201 Series Quad Block Pattern Mount (24-1)', '1201-0024-0001', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1201-series-quad-block-pattern-mount-24-1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1591/images/8355/1201-0024-0001__71259__10742.1701993437.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / goRAIL® / goRAIL® Accessories', 'gobilda'),
  ('1201 Series Quad Block Pattern Mount (27-1)', '1201-0027-0001', 'Consider this to be a Quad Block Pattern Mount for Low-Side U-Channel. While the go-to 1201-0043-0002 is perfectly compatible with 1121 Series Low-Side U-Channel, sometimes a slightly narrower ''boxed'' design lends itself well for builds that have width regulations. This 27mm wide Quad Block Pattern Mount will provide 27mm between two pieces of Low-Side U-Channel, leaving the outside to outside dimension 32mm to stay on-pattern.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1201-series-quad-block-pattern-mount-27-1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1437/images/7123/1201-0027-0001__69273__02821.1701993068.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Motor Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('1201 Series Quad Block Pattern Mount (43-2)', '1201-0043-0002', 'This is arguably the most versatile mount when building with channel. It''s threaded from the front, back and sides so it can be installed and used a number of different ways.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1201-series-quad-block-pattern-mount-43-2/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/284/images/2238/1201-0043-0002__65034__16864.1701991534.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Motor Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('1201 Series Quad Block Pattern Mount (43-3)', '1201-0043-0003', 'This Quad Block Pattern Mount is similar in function to the 1201-0043-0002, but with a condensed mounting pattern. The three holes on each side align with the 8mm grid pattern so that it''s compatible with pattern-based and grid-based parts alike. There are cases, such as in a worm gearbox, where the condensed pattern provides that extra bit of clearance you need to complete your assembly.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1201-series-quad-block-pattern-mount-43-3/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1079/images/5302/1201-0043-0003_Beauty_1__93505__39971.1701992491.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('1201 Series Quad Block Pattern Mount (43-4)', '1201-0043-0004', 'Double the options of the regular, go-to Quad Block with a second 14mm hole spaced 24mm from the center! This addition allows for incredibly cool geared assemblies with 1120 Series U-Channel.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1201-series-quad-block-pattern-mount-43-4/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1551/images/13416/1201-0043-0004-REV1-Flipped__97857.1727899823.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Motor Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('1201 Series Quad Block Pattern Mount (43-5)', '1201-0043-0005', 'Possessing extreme versatility in channel-based builds, this 1201 Series Quad Block Pattern Mount is threaded from the front, back and sides for use in nearly unlimited ways! Where the popular 1201-0043-0002 is 43mm and symmetric, the asymmetric design of the 1201-0043-0005 leaves its top edge flush with the open edge of the channel. The 16mm pattern in the mount''s center has all thru-holes so that the part can easily fasten to the side of goBILDA® goRAIL and other extrusion-based structures.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1201-series-quad-block-pattern-mount-43-5/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1748/images/9247/1201-0043-0005-Beauty3__91070__78222.1701993725.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Motor Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('1202 Series Angle Pattern Mount (1-1)', '1202-0001-0001', 'This beefy 90 degree mount has both threaded and thru-holes on the 16mm pattern. Use it to hold a bearing, sensor or motor off a surface or clad a 90 degree joint to add structural support.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1202-series-angle-pattern-mount-1-1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/286/images/2247/1202-0001-0001__36239__98622.1701991537.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('1202 Series Angle Pattern Mount (1-2)', '1202-0001-0002', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1202-series-angle-pattern-mount-1-2/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1550/images/8102/1202-0001-0002__80218__48385.1701993361.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('1202 Series Angle Pattern Mount (1-3)', '1202-0001-0003', 'This angle pattern mount makes it easy to create 90° joints in your structure. The counterbored thru-holes are large enough for the head of an M4 socket head screw. Alternatively, the counterbores can capture an M4 locknut. The non-counterbored holes are also thru-hole, which makes it easy to fasten this part to the t-slot of goRAIL®.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1202-series-angle-pattern-mount-1-3/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1636/images/8585/1202-0001-0003__74357__47903.1701993515.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Mounts / Angle Pattern Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('1203 Series Block Mount (1-1) - 4 Pack', '1203-0001-0001', 'This highly versatile Block Mount functions as a single corner of our popular 1201-0043-0002 Quad Block Pattern Mount. Its chamfered corner helps you orient the block mount according to the hole pattern and edges of surrounding components.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1203-series-block-mount-1-1-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/288/images/12470/Ang3__67242.1718657467.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Mounts / Block Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('1204 Series Gusseted Angle Mount (1-1) - 2 Pack', '1204-0001-0001', 'These compact gussets provide a clean and solid way to create or support a 90 degree angle. The counterbore allows button head screws to recess down into the mount far enough to pass one(3)-another during assembly.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1204-series-gusseted-angle-mount-1-1-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/290/images/2277/1204-0001-0001__06743__49247.1701991546.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / goRAIL® / goRAIL® Accessories', 'gobilda'),
  ('1204 Series Gusseted Angle Mount (1-2) - 2 Pack', '1204-0001-0002', 'With a 12mm distance from the base to the hole on one(4) side this part is great for creating overlapping joints with goRAIL®. The other side measures 8mm from base to center so if you use it with grid-based components it will keep items on pattern.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1204-series-gusseted-angle-mount-1-2-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/283/images/2228/1204-0001-0002__81926__68061.1701991531.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / goRAIL® / goRAIL® Accessories', 'gobilda'),
  ('1204 Series Gusseted Angle Mount (1-3) - 2 Pack', '1204-0001-0003', 'This gusset measures 12mm from the center of the hole to the base on each side. The 12mm length allows the gusset to mount to goRAIL® and the other side will be flush with the top edge of the extrusion. Use this part to create attachment points perpendicular to a surface or to support a junction between two parts.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1204-series-gusseted-angle-mount-1-3-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/285/images/2242/1204-0001-0003__51801__67468.1701991536.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / goRAIL® / goRAIL® Accessories', 'gobilda'),
  ('1204 Series Gusseted Angle Mount (2-1)', '1204-0002-0001', 'Support a 90 degree joint between two plates, channels or brackets with this gusseted angle mount. Threaded holes on every side ensure it will align with your project but also give you additional mounting points in the corner of your build.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1204-series-gusseted-angle-mount-2-1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/287/images/2255/1204-0002-0001_Ang1__08369__56772.1701991539.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Mounts / Gusseted Angle Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('1205 Series Dual Block Mount (1-1) - 2 Pack', '1205-0001-0001', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1205-series-dual-block-mount-1-1-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/289/images/2271/1205-0001-0001-Beauty-1__72247__25860.1701991545.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('1205 Series Dual Block Mount (1-2) - 2 Pack', '1205-0001-0002', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1205-series-dual-block-mount-1-2-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/291/images/2286/1205-0001-0002-rev1__08508__25521.1701991549.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('1205 Series Dual Block Mount (1-3) - 2 Pack', '1205-0001-0003', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1205-series-dual-block-mount-1-3-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/292/images/2305/1205-0001-0003__07451__23877.1701991554.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Mounts / Dual Block Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('1205 Series Dual Block Mount (1-4) - 2 Pack', '1205-0001-0004', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1205-series-dual-block-mount-1-4-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1527/images/7835/1205-0001-0004_03__09434__85040.1701993284.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Mounts / Dual Block Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('1205 Series Dual Block Mount (1-5) - 2 Pack', '1205-0001-0005', 'This Dual Block Mount is one(5) of the most versatile joining pieces goBILDA® has to offer! Much of its geometry is based on the popular 1201-0043-0002 Quad Block Pattern Mount, however, having each side independent of one(6) another allows you to use it in unique ways otherwise not possible.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1205-series-dual-block-mount-1-5-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1727/images/9062/1205-0001-0005_Ang1__02974__04852.1701993667.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Mounts / Dual Block Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('1205 Series Dual Block Mount (2-1) - 2 Pack', '1205-0002-0001', 'This Dual Block Mount is incredibly versatile as a joining piece for 1143 Series Mini Low-Side U-Channel. Threaded holes on all sides of the Dual Block Mount''s two blocks allow for the connection of segments of 1143 Series Mini Low-Side U-Channel to other components via M4 screws.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1205-series-dual-block-mount-2-1-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1978/images/10734/Ang1__17322__52329.1701994199.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Mounts / Dual Block Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('1206 Series Pattern Adaptor (16-1)', '1206-0016-0001', 'The thru-holes on this adaptor align with the 16mm pattern found on almost every goBILDA part but are slotted outward for edge-case situations where you need to align with holes spaced 24mm across the center. The counterbores allow heads of M4 socket head screws to rest below the top surface so you have a clean slate to fasten a part to. The remaining holes are positioned on the Actobotics 0.77" pattern, and threaded to 6-32 UNC so that you can fasten any Actobotics thru-hole component with…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1206-series-pattern-adaptor-16-1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/668/images/3943/1206-0016-0001__26178__01007.1701992054.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('1206 Series Pattern Adaptor (16-2)', '1206-0016-0002', 'This product has been discontinued. It has been replaced by 1206-0016-0006. This adaptor has 0.140" thru-holes on the Actobotics 0.770" pattern and M4 tapped holes on the goBILDA 16mm pattern.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1206-series-pattern-adaptor-16-2/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/670/images/3954/1206-0016-0002__67731__87426.1701992057.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('1206 Series Pattern Adaptor (16-3)', '1206-0016-0003', 'This adaptor has 6-32 tapped holes on the Tetrix 0.625" (16mm) pattern and 4mm thru-holes on the goBILDA 16mm pattern.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1206-series-pattern-adaptor-16-3/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/662/images/3927/1206-0016-0003__28322__36797.1701992049.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('1206 Series Pattern Adaptor (16-4)', '1206-0016-0004', 'This pattern adaptor contains thru-holes for M4 screws on the goBILDA 16mm pattern, 6-32 UNC threaded holes on the Actobotics 0.77" hub pattern and thru-holes for 6-32 screws on the Actobotics 1.5" hub pattern. Use it to adapt a 5202 Series Yellow Jacket Gear Motor to your Actobotics assembly or fasten structural components together with ease when mixing the two systems. When using with a 5202 Series Yellow Jacket Gear Motor, the included M4 screws will nest down into the counterbores of the…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1206-series-pattern-adaptor-16-4/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1125/images/5628/1206-0016-0004-Ang-3__65533__26843.1701992594.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Pattern Adaptors', 'gobilda'),
  ('1206 Series Pattern Adaptor (16-5) - 2 Pack', '1206-0016-0005', 'This pattern adaptor is compatible with many of the major players when it comes to wheels for competition robots. The adaptor has the 16mm goBILDA pattern in the center so that you can fasten a hub or component to the center to drive the wheel of your choice. The goBILDA pattern has been counterbored to maintain a flat face for the wheel to rest against. Each tab on the adaptor possesses three different holes, each of a slightly different diameter and pattern diameter in order to accommodate…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1206-series-pattern-adaptor-16-5-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1223/images/6098/1206-0016-0005__97921__33730.1701992748.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('Thru-Hole Actobotics to Threaded goBILDA® Pattern Adaptor', '1206-0016-0006', 'The thru-holes on this adaptor align with the 0.77" pattern of the Actobotics build-system. 6-32 screws or 6-32 locknuts (5/16" hex-size) are able to rest down in the counterbores, leaving the top surface clean and clear for the next part to fasten to. The M4 threaded holes are positioned on the 16mm grid pattern found throughout goBILDA. As an added bonus, 1mm deep counterbores have been added to both the top and bottom of this adaptor so you can use it in various ways to hold and capture a…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/thru-hole-actobotics-to-threaded-gobilda-pattern-adaptor/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1509/images/7717/1206-0016-0006_02__19391__08580.1701993245.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Pattern Adaptors', 'gobilda'),
  ('Threaded Actobotics to Thru-Hole goBILDA® Pattern Adaptor', '1206-0016-0007', 'The thru-holes on this adaptor align with the 16mm pattern found on almost every goBILDA part but are slotted outward for edge-case situations where you need to align with holes spaced 24mm across the center. The counterbores allow heads of M4 socket head screws to rest below the top surface so you have a clean slate to fasten a part to. The counterbores are machined as a hex-profile in order to accept and capture an M4 locknut if you prefer to have screws come up through the bottom. The…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/threaded-actobotics-to-thru-hole-gobilda-pattern-adaptor/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1675/images/8754/1206-0016-0007_02__16566__93178.1701993569.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('Threaded Tetrix to Thru-Hole goBILDA® Pattern Adaptor', '1206-0016-0008', 'The thru-holes on this adaptor align with the 16mm pattern found on almost every goBILDA part but are slotted outward for edge-case situations where you need to align with holes spaced 24mm across the center. The counterbores allow heads of M4 socket head screws to rest below the top surface so you have a clean slate to fasten a part to. The counterbores are machined as a hex-profile in order to accept and capture an M4 locknut if you prefer to have screws come up through the bottom. The…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/threaded-tetrix-to-thru-hole-gobilda-pattern-adaptor-16-8/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1555/images/8139/1206-0016-0008_02__32146__56614.1701993371.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Pattern Adaptors', 'gobilda'),
  ('Threaded REV to Thru-Hole goBILDA® Pattern Adaptor', '1206-0016-0009', 'The thru-holes on this adaptor align with the 16mm pattern found on almost every goBILDA part but are slotted outward for edge-case situations where you need to align with holes spaced 24mm across the center. The counterbores allow heads of M4 socket head screws to rest below the top surface so you have a clean slate to fasten a part to. The M3 threaded holes align with the REV pattern that measures 16mm across center. These holes allow you to fasten nearly any REV component that has…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/threaded-rev-to-thru-hole-gobilda-pattern-adaptor/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1601/images/8405/1206-0016-0009_02__81248__44962.1701993453.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Pattern Adaptors', 'gobilda'),
  ('Thru-Hole REV to Threaded goBILDA® Pattern Adaptor', '1206-0016-0010', 'This adaptor has thru-holes on two different REV patterns: With screws or nuts slid to one(7) extreme within the counterbored slot, they will align with the 4 x 16mm pattern found on some REV parts. Slide the screws or nuts to the other end of the slots and they''ll align with the 6 x 16mm pattern found on other REV parts. The remaining holes are tapped to M4 on the goBILDA 16mm grid pattern so that you can fasten to about any goBILDA component that suits your fancy.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/thru-hole-rev-to-threaded-gobilda-pattern-adaptor/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1603/images/8418/1206-0016-0010_02__09047__19095.1701993459.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Pattern Adaptors', 'gobilda'),
  ('Thru-Hole Tetrix to Threaded goBILDA® Pattern Adaptor', '1206-0016-0011', 'The thru-holes of this adaptor align with the 16mm pattern of the Tetrix build system. The 6-32 screws or 6-32 locknuts from your Tetrix toolbox fit nicely in the counterbores, leaving the top surface clean and clear for the fastening of your next component. And because this is a Tetrix-to-goBILDA® adaptor, that next component can be a goBILDA® one(8)! The M4 threaded holes match the 16mm square pattern found throughout goBILDA®. The 8mm center hole–which is smaller than is standard in…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/thru-hole-tetrix-to-threaded-gobilda-pattern-adaptor-16-11/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2030/images/11120/1206-0016-0011-Beauty__69238__63984.1701994323.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Pattern Adaptors', 'gobilda'),
  ('Thru-Hole AndyMark Robits to Threaded goBILDA® Pattern Adaptor', '1206-0016-0012', 'Looking to blend build systems? Pattern adaptors are here to help! This particular adaptor can fasten to AndyMark''s Robits Tube using 10-32 (or M5) hardware, with the remaining holes being four M4 threaded holes on the goBILDA® 16mm square pattern. To maximize versatility, the Robits pattern options are plentiful: you''ll find them down the center of the adaptor in order to align the part down the center of the ½"-spaced holes, as well as flanking each side of the center so that it can…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/thru-hole-andymark-robits-to-threaded-gobilda-pattern-adaptor/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2476/images/16530/Ang1__17460.1776459204.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Pattern Adaptors', 'gobilda'),
  ('1206 Series Pattern Adaptor (32-5)', '1206-0032-0005', 'This product has been discontinued. It has been replaced by the 1206-0032-0006. This adaptor has 0.140" thru-holes on the Actobotics® 0.770" pattern and M4 tapped holes on the goBILDA® 32mm pattern. Four 6-32 x 3/8" length flat head screws are included so that you can fasten this adapter to an Actobotics® hub or threaded component while leaving the face flush for mounting a goBILDA® component to.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1206-series-pattern-adaptor-32-5/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/665/images/3933/1206-0032-0005__26172__79072.1701992051.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('1206 Series Pattern Adaptor (32-6)', '1206-0032-0006', 'This adaptor has thru-holes on the Actobotics 0.77" pattern as that will allow 6-32 UNC socket head screws to fit down in the counterbores, leaving a clean surface to fasten parts to. In addition to the thru-holes, we''ve clocked a second set of holes that are threaded to 6-32 so you can thread right into it if that''s your style. Once you''ve fastened your Actobotics part to one(9) side, the other side is ready for a goBILDA part to clad on, with the use of the M4 holes on the 32mm pattern found on…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1206-series-pattern-adaptor-32-6/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1459/images/7290/1206-0032-0006-Beauty-1__26241__08825.1701993117.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('Limit Switch Trigger (1-1)', '1207-0001-0001', 'This Limit Switch Trigger is able to fasten to one(10) end of the 3503-0804-0038 Lead Screw Nut. The profile is matched to that of Open goRAIL® and the extra bit of material will hang over the side of the goRAIL® to make contact with a micro limit switch mounted to the side of the Open goRAIL®.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/limit-switch-trigger-1-1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1500/images/7656/1207-0001-0001_02__50929__48811.1701993230.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / goRAIL® / goRAIL® Accessories', 'gobilda'),
  ('Micro Limit Switch Mount (32-1) - 2 Pack', '1207-0032-0001', 'Mount your limit switches to a channel, grid plate, or beam with this mounting kit. The slotted holes enable you to fine-tune the location of the switches so they open and close the circuit at precisely the right time.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1207-series-switch-mount-32-1-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/296/images/2317/1207-0032-0001__97702__19141.1701991558.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Switches / Limit Switches', 'gobilda'),
  ('Micro Limit Switch Mount (32-2) - 2 Pack', '1207-0032-0002', 'This limit switch mount offers several different mounting possibilities. The increased width over the 1207-0032-0001 enables it to span across the slot of goRAIL®.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/micro-limit-switch-mount-32-2-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1028/images/5003/1207-0032-0002__98048__21197.1701992395.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / goRAIL® / goRAIL® Accessories', 'gobilda'),
  ('1208 Series Surface Mount (1-1)', '1208-0001-0001', 'This mount is commonly used on the end of goRAIL® to fasten a threaded part such as a pillow block or pattern mount. It can also be used on the side of goRAIL® while keeping mating parts with a 24mm height on pattern so that gears and drive components properly align.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1208-series-surface-mount-1-1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/298/images/2326/1208-0001-0001-Rev1__30973__90495.1701991561.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / goRAIL® / goRAIL® Accessories', 'gobilda'),
  ('1208 Series Surface Mount (1-2)', '1208-0001-0002', 'This compact surface mount allows you to create a 90 degree joint between two pieces of goRAIL while providing access to the center hole of the goRAIL for routing wires or running shafting through.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1208-series-surface-mount-1-2/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/300/images/2338/1208-0001-0002__17559__43169.1701991564.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('Battery Mount for 12V NiMH Nested Battery', '1209-0001-0001', 'This profile-matched Battery Mount provides a simple, secure way to fasten a 12V NiMH Nested Battery to your robot. Its six hex-counterbored thru-holes allow for an easy one(11)-tool installation in which M4 screws can be inserted from the bottom side. The hook-and-loop strap harnesses your battery to the mount to prevent any chance of slippage. While this Mount''s form factor is designed for attachment on the outside of goBILDA® U-Channel, the walls that barricade your battery are thoughtfully…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/battery-mount-for-12v-nimh-nested-battery/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2386/images/14830/1209-0001-0001__35443__85938.1746799544.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Batteries / Battery Mounts & Trays', 'gobilda'),
  ('Hook & Loop Cinch-Strap with Mounting Plates', '1209-0032-0001', 'This kit, which comes with the necessary hardware to mount a 3100-0012-0020 battery to 1120 Series U-Channel or 1121 Series Low-Side U-Channel, is perfect for any situation where you''d like to harness an object to goBILDA® structure. The acetal plastic tabs act as a loom to route the Velcro cinch-strap through to secure your battery or other component.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/hook-loop-cinch-strap-with-mounting-plates/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/301/images/2341/1209-0032-0001__41898__30965.1701991566.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Batteries / Battery Mounts & Trays', 'gobilda'),
  ('1211 Series Angle Mount (1-1)', '1211-0001-0001', 'This angle mount is an integral part of a linear motion build when using v-groove bearings and v-guide inside channel. Notice the slots so that you can achieve the perfect distance between v-groove bearings for a super-smooth, no slop setup. The threaded holes will be flush with the top of the 1120 Series U-Channel and allow easy mounting of other components.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1211-series-angle-mount-1-1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/293/images/2292/1211-0001-0001__13390__38622.1701991552.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Mounts / Angle Pattern Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('Steel 90 Degree Angle Bracket (1-1) - 4 Pack', '1216-0001-0001', 'This steel 90° bracket is a sturdy solution for right angles in your project! The two primary thru-holes (located at 90° to one(12) another) allow for versatile joinings and compact reinforcement of your project''s structure via M4 screws and locknuts. The bonus thru-hole in the bracket''s diagonal face provides for eclectic attachments at 45°.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/steel-90-degree-angle-bracket-1-1-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2012/images/11035/1216-0001-0001_Stand_Up__27986__90624.1701994293.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Brackets / Angle Brackets', 'gobilda'),
  ('1221 Series 2-Side, 2-Post Pattern Mount (32-1)', '1221-0032-0001', 'Space two of these pattern mounts 32mm apart to achieve a 43mm overall width. This width is useful when mounting items in 1120 Series U-Channel.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1221-series-2-side-2-post-pattern-mount-32-1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/294/images/2301/1221-0032-0001__81664__92619.1701991553.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Mounts / 2-Side, 2-Post Pattern Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('1221 Series 2-Side, 2-Post Pattern Mount (32-2)', '1221-0032-0002', 'These pattern mounts allow you to space parallel components 32mm apart while providing a mounting surface perpendicular to those components. The 4mm offset from the center of the threaded holes to the face ensures that your project remains on pattern.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1221-series-2-side-2-post-pattern-mount-32-2/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/295/images/2313/1221-0032-0002_Current__34220__27091.1701991556.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Mounts / 2-Side, 2-Post Pattern Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('1222 Series Flat Pattern Mount (1-1)', '1222-0001-0001', 'This Flat Pattern Mount is able to fasten to a part which has threaded holes on the goBILDA® 16mm square pattern, leaving the screw heads flush with the top surface. The clean slate allows other parts (such as a ball bearing or a thrust bearing) to rest against that surface. The hex counterbores—on the goBILDA® 16mm square pattern on the front of the mount, and the goBILDA® 32mm square pattern on the back—can seat screws'' hex heads, as well as hex nuts for screws going the other way, providing…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1222-series-flat-pattern-mount-1-1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1094/images/11291/1222-0001-0001_Ang1__39508.1707402669.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / goRAIL® / goRAIL® Accessories', 'gobilda'),
  ('Motor Controller Mount for Basic Micro RoboClaw 2x7A', '1224-0016-0001', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/motor-controller-mount-for-basic-micro-roboclaw-2x7a/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1030/images/5008/1224-0016-0001__09865__46626.1701992397.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Motor Controllers / Motor Controller Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('Motor Controller Mount for Basic Micro RoboClaw 2x15A, 2x30A, 2x45A', '1224-0016-0002', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/motor-controller-mount-for-basic-micro-roboclaw-2x15a-2x30a-2x45a/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1031/images/5012/1224-0016-0002__99752__33121.1701992399.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Motor Controllers / Motor Controller Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('Motor Controller Mount for Basic Micro RoboClaw 2x60A', '1224-0016-0003', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/motor-controller-mount-for-basic-micro-roboclaw-2x60a/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1032/images/5017/1224-0016-0003__74979__84442.1701992401.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Motor Controllers / Motor Controller Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('Motor Controller Mount for Basic Micro RoboClaw 1x60A', '1224-0016-0004', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/motor-controller-mount-for-basic-micro-roboclaw-1x60a/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1053/images/5141/1224-0016-0004__84296__96902.1701992443.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Motor Controllers / Motor Controller Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('1225 Series Flat Mount for V-Groove Bearings (1-1) - 2 Pack', '1225-0001-0001', 'This Flat Mount provides threaded holes spaced 24mm apart so that V-Groove Bearings can be mounted the proper distance from one(13) another to run on V-Guide. The additional row of threaded holes are to give you numerous mounting options. Having two independent mounts gives you the freedom to pick the distance between the pairs of V-Groove Bearings. Put them close together for maximum travel or spread them apart to counteract the forces that a long moment arm may be applying to your assembly.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1225-series-flat-mount-for-v-groove-bearings-1-1-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1092/images/5429/1225-0001-0001__65086__94307.1701992529.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Mounts / Flat Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('1300 Series Set Screw Hub (6mm D-Bore)', '1300-0016-1006', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1300-series-set-screw-hub-6mm-d-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/297/images/2318/1300-0016-1006-Patented__86483__42902.1701991558.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('1301 Series Clamping Hub (6mm Bore)', '1301-0016-0006', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1301-series-clamping-hub-6mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/299/images/2331/1301-0016-0006__91685__71970.1701991562.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('1301 Series Clamping Hub (8mm Bore)', '1301-0016-0008', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1301-series-clamping-hub-8mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/302/images/2346/1301-0016-0008__40371__16845.1701991568.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('1301 Series Clamping Hub (10mm Bore)', '1301-0016-0010', 'This 10mm Bore Clamping Hub provides a non-marring solution for fastening parts onto a 10mm diameter shaft. When the M4 pinch bolt is tightened, it locks to the shaft to secure the attachment of the hub and the components mounted to it. The 14mm OD protrusion offers a centering mechanism for mounted components that have a 14mm bore.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1301-series-clamping-hub-10mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/304/images/2357/1301-0016-0010-Rev1__86264__81300.1701991570.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Hubs / Shop by Hub Style / Classic Clamping Hubs', 'gobilda'),
  ('1301 Series Clamping Hub (12mm Bore)', '1301-0016-0012', 'This 12mm Bore Clamping Hub provides a tight grasp on items with a 12mm OD, such as shafting and tubing. The M4 pinch bolt constricts the hub for a non-marring grasp. Its 16mm square pattern can be found throughout goBILDA®—use this hub to attach a gear, pulley, sprocket, or even a structural component to your build!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1301-series-clamping-hub-12mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/306/images/13226/1301-0016-0012-Rev1__41532__85612.1724180478.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Hubs / Shop by Hub Style / Classic Clamping Hubs', 'gobilda'),
  ('1301 Series Clamping Hub (14mm Bore)', '1301-0016-0014', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1301-series-clamping-hub-14mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/308/images/2381/1301-0016-0014__34968__71625.1701991577.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Hubs / Shop by Hub Style / Classic Clamping Hubs', 'gobilda'),
