  ('1306 Series HD Clamping Hub (6mm D-Bore)', '1306-0016-1006', 'The condensed pattern on the HD Clamping Hub allows it to mate with components which measure 16mm across the center bore.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1306-series-hd-clamping-hub-6mm-d-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/309/images/2383/1306-0016-1006__36844__90014.1701991577.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
