  ('1308 Series Lightweight Set-Screw Hub (6mm D-Bore)', '1308-0016-1006', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1308-series-lightweight-set-screw-hub-6mm-d-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/848/images/4664/1308-0016-1006__71044__75025.1701992262.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('1309 Series Sonic Hub (4mm Bore)', '1309-0016-0004', 'This Sonic Hub has threaded holes on the 16mm goBILDA® pattern which provide for the easy attachment of parts with thru-holes via M4 screws. The two pinch bolts offer excellent clamping force in a compact form factor. Features Made for 4mm Shafting This hub allows you to mount components to a 4mm diameter shaft. Part of a Large Ecosystem of Parts The goBILDA® ecosystem has many parts that bolt directly to this hub. That includes wheels, gears, sprockets, track sprockets, timing pulleys, round…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1309-series-sonic-hub-4mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1517/images/7757/1309-0016-0004__95092__85731.1701993259.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Hubs / Shop by Hub Bore / 4mm Round Bore Hubs', 'gobilda'),
  ('1309 Series Sonic Hub (5mm Bore)', '1309-0016-0005', 'This 5mm Bore Sonic Hub has threaded holes on the 16mm goBILDA® pattern which provide for the easy attachment of parts with thru-holes via M4 screws. The two pinch bolts offer excellent clamping force in a compact form factor. Features Made for 5mm Shafting This hub allows you to mount components to a 5mm diameter shaft. Part of a Large Ecosystem of Parts The goBILDA® ecosystem has many parts that bolt directly to this hub. That includes wheels, gears, sprockets, track sprockets, timing…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1309-series-sonic-hub-5mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1520/images/7773/1309-0016-0005__37492__74883.1701993264.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Hubs / Shop by Hub Bore / 5mm Round Bore Hubs', 'gobilda'),
  ('1309 Series Sonic Hub (6mm Bore)', '1309-0016-0006', 'The 6mm round bore Sonic Hub can be used on 6mm round shafting, 6mm OD standoffs and spacers and even 6mm D-shaft. There are some use-cases where you need to clamp onto something other than a D-shaft, or, maybe you want to clamp onto a D-shaft while retaining the freedom to clock your hub independent of the location of the flat on the shaft. As with all Sonic Hubs, this hub is balanced and possesses two pinch bolts to maximize the clamping force while maintaining a slim profile. Features Made…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1309-series-sonic-hub-6mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1278/images/6350/1309-0016-0006-Rev1__36288__39456.1701992823.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Hubs / Shop by Hub Bore / 6mm Round Bore Hubs', 'gobilda'),
  ('1309 Series Sonic Hub (8mm Bore)', '1309-0016-0008', 'This 8mm Round Bore Sonic Hub has threaded holes on the 16mm goBILDA® pattern which provide for the easy attachment of parts with thru-holes via M4 screws. The two pinch bolts offer excellent clamping force in a compact form factor. Features Made for 8mm Shafting This hub allows you to mount components to an 8mm diameter shaft. Part of a Large Ecosystem of Parts The goBILDA® ecosystem has many parts that bolt directly to this hub. That includes wheels, gears, sprockets, track sprockets, timing…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1309-series-sonic-hub-8mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1521/images/7783/1309-0016-0008__36259__42996.1701993268.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Hubs / Shop by Hub Bore / 8mm Round Bore Hubs', 'gobilda'),
  ('1309 Series Sonic Hub (1/4" Bore)', '1309-0016-0250', 'This 1/4" Round Bore Sonic Hub has threaded holes on the 16mm goBILDA® pattern which provide for the easy attachment of parts with thru-holes via M4 screws. The two pinch bolts offer excellent clamping force in a compact form factor. Features Made for a 1/4" Shaft This hub allows you to mount components to a 1/4" diameter shaft. Part of a Large Ecosystem of Parts The goBILDA® ecosystem has many parts that bolt directly to this hub. That includes wheels, gears, sprockets, track sprockets,…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1309-series-sonic-hub-1-4-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1523/images/7803/1309-0016-0250__21554__28365.1701993274.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Hubs / Shop by Hub Bore / 1/4" Round Bore Hubs', 'gobilda'),
  ('1309 Series Sonic Hub (5/16" Bore)', '1309-0016-0312', 'This 5/16" Round Bore Sonic Hub has threaded holes on the 16mm goBILDA® pattern which provide for the easy attachment of parts with thru-holes via M4 screws. The two pinch bolts offer excellent clamping force in a compact form factor. Features Made for a 5/16" Shaft This hub allows you to mount components to a 5/16" diameter shaft. Part of a Large Ecosystem of Parts The goBILDA® ecosystem has many parts that bolt directly to this hub. That includes wheels, gears, sprockets, track sprockets,…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1309-series-sonic-hub-5-16-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2416/images/15167/1309-0016-0312__85738__27613.1757097905.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Hubs / Shop by Hub Bore / 5/16" Round Bore Hubs', 'gobilda'),
  ('1309 Series Sonic Hub (6mm D-Bore)', '1309-0016-1006', 'This 6mm D-Bore Sonic Hub has threaded holes on the 16mm pattern which provide for the easy attachment of parts with thru-holes via M4 screws. The two pinch bolts offer excellent clamping force in a compact form factor. Features Made for 6mm D-Shaft This hub allows you to mount components to a 6mm D-shaft. Part of a Large Ecosystem of Parts The goBILDA® ecosystem has many parts that bolt directly to this hub. That includes wheels, gears, sprockets, track sprockets, timing pulleys, round belt…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1309-series-sonic-hub-6mm-d-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1085/images/5350/1309-0016-1006-Beauty-Shot__54732__32310.1701992505.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Pattern Adaptors', 'gobilda'),
  ('1309 Series Sonic Hub (1/4" D-Bore)', '1309-0016-1250', 'This 1/4" D-Bore Sonic Hub has threaded holes on the 16mm goBILDA® pattern which provide for the easy attachment of parts with thru-holes via M4 screws. The two pinch bolts offer excellent clamping force in a compact form factor. Features Made for a 1/4" D-Shaft This hub allows you to mount components to a 1/4" diameter D-shaft. Part of a Large Ecosystem of Parts The goBILDA® ecosystem has many parts that bolt directly to this hub. That includes wheels, gears, sprockets, track sprockets,…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1309-series-sonic-hub-1-4-d-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1525/images/7821/1309-0016-1250__53884__14207.1701993280.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Pattern Adaptors', 'gobilda'),
  ('1309 Series Sonic Hub (5mm Hex Bore)', '1309-0016-2005', 'The 5mm Hex Bore Sonic Hub is an excellent option when fastening a goBILDA® component, such as a gear, pulley or wheel to a REV Robotics 5mm Hex Shaft. The dual clamping setup maintains the balance so that you don''t introduce vibrations in high speed applications. The threaded holes on the 16mm goBILDA® pattern provide for the easy attachment of parts with thru-holes via M4 screws. Features Made for 5mm Hex Shafting This hub allows you to mount components to a 5mm hex shaft. Part of a Large…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1309-series-sonic-hub-5mm-hex-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1126/images/5636/1309-0016-2005__56149__91792.1701992596.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Pattern Adaptors', 'gobilda'),
  ('1309 Series Sonic Hub (8mm REX® Bore)', '1309-0016-4008', 'This hub has an 8mm REX® bore to match our 8mm REX® shafting. The hex profile creates a positive drive that can handle heavy torque loads without concern of rounding out. The Sonic style hub is perfectly balanced for high-speed applications. The unique design conforms tightly around a shaft when tightened, and it does so without distorting the threaded holes on the goBILDA® 16mm pattern. The outer profile is 32mm so that it can be run in a bearing to isolate radial loads — or even clamped…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1309-series-sonic-hub-8mm-rex-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1222/images/6086/1309-0016-4008__54144__86371.1701992744.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Hubs / Shop by Hub Bore / 8mm REX® Bore Hubs', 'gobilda'),
  ('1310 Series Hyper Hub (8mm Bore)', '1310-0016-0008', 'The 8mm Bore Hyper Hub is a heavy duty, balanced, clamping solution to fastening onto an 8mm round shaft. The dual pinch-bolts put a mega-hold on the shaft, and the extended length of the hub offers excellent surface contact with the shaft. A built-in shim provides for contact with a bearing without binding against the bearing''s outer race. And as with all Hyper Hubs, this hub is balanced so that it can be used in high-speed applications without introducing vibrations. Features Made for 8mm…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1310-series-hyper-hub-8mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1100/images/15303/1310-0016-0008__24855.1759518275.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Hubs / Shop by Hub Bore / 8mm Round Bore Hubs', 'gobilda'),
  ('1310 Series Hyper Hub (12mm Bore)', '1310-0016-0012', 'Features Made for 12mm Shafting This hub allows you to mount components to a 12mm Shaft. Part of a Large Ecosystem of Parts The goBILDA® ecosystem has many parts that bolt directly to this hub. That includes wheels, gears, sprockets, track sprockets, timing pulleys, round belt pulleys, winch pulleys, control arms, and more! High-Speed Design - Completely Balanced The innovative Hyper Hub design is perfectly balanced. It will not introduce vibrations into your build, even in high-speed…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1310-series-hyper-hub-12mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1461/images/11927/1310-0016-0012__52211.1715803751.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Hubs / Shop by Hub Bore / 12mm Round Bore Hubs', 'gobilda'),
  ('1310 Series Hyper Hub (1/4" Bore)', '1310-0016-0250', 'Features Made for 1/4" Shafting This hub allows you to mount components to a 1/4" diameter shaft. Part of a Large Ecosystem of Parts The goBILDA® ecosystem has many parts that bolt directly to this hub. That includes wheels, gears, sprockets, track sprockets, timing pulleys, round belt pulleys, winch pulleys, control arms, and more! High-Speed Design - Completely Balanced The innovative Hyper Hub design is perfectly balanced. It will not introduce vibrations into your build, even in high-speed…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1310-series-hyper-hub-1-4-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1528/images/11923/1310-0016-0250__96722.1715803642.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Hubs / Shop by Hub Bore / 1/4" Round Bore Hubs', 'gobilda'),
  ('1310 Series Hyper Hub (3/8" Bore)', '1310-0016-0375', 'Features Made for 3/8" Shafting This hub allows you to mount components to a 3/8" diameter shaft. Part of a Large Ecosystem of Parts The goBILDA® ecosystem has many parts that bolt directly to this hub. That includes wheels, gears, sprockets, track sprockets, timing pulleys, round belt pulleys, winch pulleys, control arms, and more! High-Speed Design - Completely Balanced The innovative Hyper Hub design is perfectly balanced. It will not introduce vibrations into your build, even in high-speed…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1310-series-hyper-hub-3-8-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1531/images/11917/1310-0016-0375__23235.1715803585.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Hubs / Shop by Hub Bore / 3/8" Round Bore Hubs', 'gobilda'),
  ('1310 Series Hyper Hub (1/2" Bore)', '1310-0016-0500', 'Features Made for 1/2" Shafting This hub allows you to mount components to a 1/2" diameter shaft. Part of a Large Ecosystem of Parts The goBILDA® ecosystem has many parts that bolt directly to this hub. That includes wheels, gears, sprockets, track sprockets, timing pulleys, round belt pulleys, winch pulleys, control arms, and more! High-Speed Design - Completely Balanced The innovative Hyper Hub design is perfectly balanced. It will not introduce vibrations into your build, even in high-speed…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1310-series-hyper-hub-1-2-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1522/images/11910/1310-0016-0500__77047.1715803507.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Hubs / Shop by Hub Bore / 1/2" Round Bore Hubs', 'gobilda'),
  ('1310 Series Hyper Hub (6mm D-Bore)', '1310-0016-1006', 'The 6mm D-Bore Hyper Hub is a heavy-duty, balanced, clamping solution to fastening onto a 6mm D-Shaft. The dual pinch-bolts put a mega-hold on the shaft and the extended length of the hub offers excellent surface contact with the shaft. The D-profile matches a 6mm D-shaft so that a positive drive is created and there''s essentially no chance of slipping. As with all Hyper Couplers, this coupler is balanced so that it can be used in high-speed applications without introducing vibrations.…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1310-series-hyper-hub-6mm-d-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1093/images/11905/1310-0016-1006__43268.1715803404.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Pattern Adaptors', 'gobilda'),
  ('1310 Series Hyper Hub (1/4" D-Bore)', '1310-0016-1250', 'Features Made for 1/4" D-Shafting This hub allows you to mount components to a 1/4" D-shaft. Part of a Large Ecosystem of Parts The goBILDA® ecosystem has many parts that bolt directly to this hub. That includes wheels, gears, sprockets, track sprockets, timing pulleys, round belt pulleys, winch pulleys, control arms, and more! High-Speed Design - Completely Balanced The innovative Hyper Hub design is perfectly balanced. It will not introduce vibrations into your build, even in high-speed…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1310-series-hyper-hub-1-4-d-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1530/images/11901/1310-0016-1250__34668.1715802255.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda')
